blocks.en:
For the export stage, L1 groups tokenization-related entities such as Tokenizer export , Normalizer , and Vocabulary ;
L2 captures multimodal preprocessing components such as Resampler ;
L3 organizes model initialization logic including Model config and Weight loading ;
L5 groups module-level transformations such as LayerNorm and Linear ;
L7 captures attention-related components including Attention , KV cache , and Rotary position ;
and L8 connects high-level operators with their lowered implementations, such as mapping Attention to Fuse attention .
The execution-stage hierarchy further exposes corresponding runtime responsibilities:
L1 contains runtime token processing entities such as BPE encoder and special token mapping;
L2 includes vision feature processing and multimodal fusion;
L5 groups runtime execution logic including module forward, graph traversal, and memory management;
L7 captures fused attention kernels and native flexible KV cache implementations;
L8 contains concrete operators such as Convolution and QNN MatMul ;
and L9 reaches hardware-specific implementations such as ARM INT4 pack , I8MM , and SME2 GEMM . These examples demonstrate that the generated hierarchy is not a syntactic partition of the repository, but a semantic mapping between engine functionalities and concrete code entities.
It enables agents to reason about how high-level model functionalities are implemented across different abstraction layers.

blocks.zh:
就出口阶段而言,L1将标语化相关实体分组,如Tokenizer出口、Normalizer和词汇;
L2 捕获诸如Resampler等多式联运预处理组件;
L3组织模型初始化逻辑,包括模型配置和重量加载;
L5组模块级转换,如LayerNorm和Linear;
L7捕捉与注意力有关的组件,包括注意、KV缓存和Rotary位置;
L8将高层运营商与低级实施联系起来,
执行阶段的层级进一步暴露了相应的运行时间责任:
L1包含运行时令牌处理实体,如BPE编码器和特殊令牌映射; 2.
L2包括视觉特性处理和多式联运;
L5组运行时执行逻辑,包括模块前传,图轨,和内存管理; 2.
L7 捕获已连接的注意内核和本地灵活的 KV 缓存执行;
L8载有诸如Convolution和QNN MatMul等混凝土操作器;
和L9达到硬件特定执行,如ARM INT4包、I8MM和SME2 GEMM。 这些例子表明,生成的阶梯不是寄存器的合成分区,而是引擎功能和混凝土代码实体之间的语义映射.
它使代理商能够解释如何在不同抽象层中实施高层次模型功能.
